# The key map, both columns: with no prefix, and after the tmux prefix.
title lmux keys
size 134 36
pre lmux kill --all
run demo-shell
wait 1
type clear
enter
wait 0.5
chapter The key map
caption lmux keys | the keys with no prefix, and the same after Ctrl+b
type lmux keys | head -33
enter
wait 1.5
frame 6
